<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-005" chapter-id="c-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother" source-id="s-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother-ws2027696">
  <p id="c-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">廢帝東昏侯諱<persName id="c-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother:p001:m0006" ref="w4m_9tw_147_A">寶卷</persName>，字<persName id="c-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother:p001:m0010" ref="w4m_9tw_147_A">智藏</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother:p001:m0013" ref="w4m_9tw_147">明帝</persName>第二子也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">夏四月丙午朔，<persName id="c-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother:p002:m0007" ref="8dc_745_f37">魏孝文皇帝</persName>崩。己巳，立皇子<persName id="c-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother:p002:m0020" ref="w4m_9tw_147_AA">誦</persName>為皇太子，大赦，賜為父後者爵一級。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">太子所生母<persName id="c-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother:p003:m0005" ref="nxr_ok6_sn7">黃貴嬪</persName>早亡，令<persName id="c-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother:p003:m0012" ref="gp4_61p_jwc">潘妃</persName>母養之。拜<persName id="c-nanshi-005-song-emperor-and-mother:p003:m0019" ref="gp4_61p_jwc">潘氏</persName>為貴妃</p>
</text>
